OL,3,AJensen Huang: Silicon Valley superstar
OL,4,Aengulfed by personal scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FJensen Huang is one of the technology
OL,7,Findustry's most high-profile figures.
OL,9,FHe rose to prominence as the business
OL,10,Fhe leads - artificial intelligence (AI)
OL,11,Fchip giant Nvidia - became one of the
OL,12,Fworld's most valuable companies.
OL,14,FAs the face of the AI boom, Huang also
OL,15,Fbecame close to Donald Trump as the
OL,16,Fpresident pushed for the US to keep its
OL,17,Fdominance of the technology over China.
